  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The apparent coefficients of volume expansion of a &nbsp;liquid filled in vessel A and B of identical volumes are found to be&nbsp;<math><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi> <mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>, respectively. If <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>α</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;be the coefficient of&nbsp; linear expansion of A then&nbsp;the coefficient of&nbsp; linear expansion&nbsp;of B will be</p>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&alpha;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mi>γ</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>γ</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mi>α</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&alpha;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mi>&alpha;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
