  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let V be the volume of the liquid and <math> <mrow> <mo>&#916;</mo> <mtext>T</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;the rise in temperature. Since apparent expansion = true expansion - expansion of vessel<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mtext>V</mtext><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>T</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>V</mtext><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>T-V</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>T</mtext></math><br /><br />or,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mn>3</mn> <msub> <mi>&#945;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(i)<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(for vessel A)<br /><br />and&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mn>3</mn> <msub> <mi>&#945;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(ii)<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(for vessel B)<br /><br />where <math> <mrow> <mi>&#947;</mi> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;is the coefficient of real expansion of the liquid.<br />Subtracting Eq. (ii) from Eq. (i),<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&#945;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&#945;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&#945;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&#945;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>/</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>"
  }
